    "detailed_description": "ProtoDungeon: Episode III is a short adventure game which draws from Game Boy Color sensibilities. Escape from the Third Nightmare, using nothing but the magic item you find there beneath a shriveled lotus tree. Jump, swim, and dash to unlock your way through a seaside cove, discover what's inside the shipwreck, and maybe get closer to solving the mystery of the nightmare prison by reaching that familiar chapel...<br><br><i>ProtoDungeon</i> is the mini-series prequel to <i>The Waking Cloak</i>. Stay tuned for further announcements!<br><br><strong>Note</strong>: you don't need to play the first two episodes to enjoy this one!",
    "about_the_game": "ProtoDungeon: Episode III is a short adventure game which draws from Game Boy Color sensibilities. Escape from the Third Nightmare, using nothing but the magic item you find there beneath a shriveled lotus tree. Jump, swim, and dash to unlock your way through a seaside cove, discover what's inside the shipwreck, and maybe get closer to solving the mystery of the nightmare prison by reaching that familiar chapel...<br><br><i>ProtoDungeon</i> is the mini-series prequel to <i>The Waking Cloak</i>. Stay tuned for further announcements!<br><br><strong>Note</strong>: you don't need to play the first two episodes to enjoy this one!",
    "short_description": "Jump, swim, and dash ahead to unlock your way out of the Third Nightmare: a lonely cove with lurking monsters, a strange shipwreck, and terrified villagers. Can you make it to the chapel to escape? Can you uncover the secrets of the nightmare prison?",
